I wouldn't enter Ludios without reflection for the reasons you just 
stated, not to mention there is usually
at least one black dragon who will disintegrate you unless you are 
resistant. If you have already cleaned out
sokoban and the mines you don't have much choice but to head down. You 
might chance the first few levels
of the quest just to see if there is anything interesting, but I like to 
hold off the quest as long as possible -
usually, I storm the castle first and after I've wished for what I need 
I then take on the quest.

You might be able to get to medusa by using the scrolls of earth in 
sokoban and creating a path there.
Wands of cold are good for that too, but caution is advised - 
particularly if there are red dragons or nagas
hanging about. And of course, kill the eels before crossing the water.

Hope this helps.

